<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079222/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079223" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Illustrissimo atque Celeberrimo Viro
          <l/><choice><abbr>Jo:</abbr><expan>Johanni</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoullio</rs> <choice><abbr>P.</abbr><expan>Petrus</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>An.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Antonius</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelottus<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice></rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Tuarum peregregiar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2 biblio_JAFFCHKU" type="biblio">Dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, meique
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">de Separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in Corpore Animali</rs> Ope<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ris exemplaria duo ad Te, Vir Sapientissime,
      <lb/>iam pervenisse <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolani</rs> via spero. Eam vero
      <lb/>quam per <rs key="place_GEO-2775220" type="place">Oenipont<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> ad Te dedi <rs key="B_991170515150205501" type="letter">epistolam</rs>
      <lb/>fere ante mensem per tabellari<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> Tibi fuisse reddi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tam minime dubito. Verum quoniam nullam ad
      <lb/>illam ips<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515150205501" type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs> hactenus accepi responsionem,
      <lb/>cogor hac etiam vice ad Te scribere; quanquam ve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>reor ne Tibi literar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> mear<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> repetitione mole<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>stum sim. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rebam an verum sit, quod <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs>
      <lb/>cum <rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person">Newtono</rs> pro vero sumit, nimir<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>titatem tempore, quo grave describit altitudinem
      <lb/><formula>IG</formula> (<choice><abbr>Vid.</abbr><expan>Vide</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>fig.</abbr><expan>figuram</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118587544" type="person"><choice><abbr>Newtonian.</abbr><expan>Newtonianam</expan></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>prop.</abbr><expan>propositionis</expan></choice> 37 <choice><abbr>lib.</abbr><expan>libri</expan></choice> 2<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><supplied>,</supplied> 2. <choice><abbr>edit.</abbr><expan>editionis</expan></choice>)
      <lb/>egressam, <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse column<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, cujus basis
      <lb/>est foramen <formula>EF</formula>, altitudo <formula>2GI</formula>: qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rebam an
      <lb/>liceat representare velocitatem aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis
      <lb/>per <formula>2GI</formula>, uti ponit <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs>,
      <lb/>propterea quod aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis velocitas tanta
      <lb/>est ut motu uniformi posset eod<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> tempore
      <lb/>quo descripsit altitudin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <formula>IG</formula> motu accelerato, des<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cribere spatium <formula>2IG</formula>. Etenim ex hoc principio
<pb facs="1079224" n="2"/>
      <lb/>conatur idem <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs> deducere quod quantitas
      <lb/>aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> tempore modo memorato egressa
      <lb/>sit <formula>2IG\times EF</formula>. Et ex hac vero hypothesi demons<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>trata conatur probare, vim aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis
      <lb/>tot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> generant<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, sive generare
      <lb/>valent<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse, contra tua principia, <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qual<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>
      <lb/><formula>2IG\times EF</formula>. Rogo igitur etiam atque etiam
      <lb/>ut aliquod respons<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> de hac re quamcitissime
      <lb/>mihi des. Hac occasione peto ut mihi indices
      <lb/>qua ratione in tua hypothesi de vi
      <lb/>generante aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis motum, <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quali
      <lb/><formula>IG\times EF</formula>, qua, inqu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, ratione explicari possit
      <lb/>cur aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> exilientis vena angustetur
      <lb/>pressione continenter, et <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualiter agente
      <lb/>in aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> gutt<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> exilient<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>.</p> <closer><salute>Parce, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so, Vir
      <lb/>Amicissime, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>d audeam Tibi esse <choice><orig>molestu&#x0303;</orig><reg>molestus</reg></choice> meis
      <lb/>litteris, et aliquod quamcitissime fieri potest,
      <lb/>mihi dare respons<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ne dedigneris.</salute> <dateline>Dabam raptim
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice><date when="1721-05-30">30 Maii 1721.</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p>P. S. <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filius</rs> Tuus Clarissimus adhuc ruri est,
        <lb/>at post octo dies redibit in Urbem.</p></postscript>
